  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tackling land tenure issues to boost sustainable, climate-smart cocoa agroforestry</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will convert cocoa farmland to more sustainable agroforestry-based cocoa production systems. Focus is upon planting of shade trees in cocoa farms, securing forest patches and restoring degraded land.This includes registration of cocoa farm land and trees; setting up nurseries; GAP training to farmers; setting up village saving and loan associations; Payment for Ecosystem services.This will, among other things, result in:&#x2022;	15,000 ha of cocoa farmland converted to more sustainable agroforestry-based cocoa production systems.&#x2022;	5,000 (1,000 women) farmers with increased productivity and income.</narrative>
  </description>
